#: includes/arrays.php router-devtypes.php
msgid "Name"
msgstr "Jina"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Give this account a meaningful name that will be displayed."
msgstr "Ipe akaunti hii jina lenye maana ambalo litaonyeshwa."

#: includes/arrays.php router-accounts.php
msgid "Username"
msgstr "Jina la mtumiaji"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The username that will be used for authentication."
msgstr "Jina la mtumiaji litakalotumika kwa uthibitishaji."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Password"
msgstr "Nenosiri"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The password used for authentication."
msgstr "Nenosiri linalotumika kwa uthibitishaji."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Enable Password"
msgstr "Nenosiri la Kuwezesha"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Your Enable Password, if required."
msgstr "Nenosiri lako la Kuwezesha, ikiwa linahitajika."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Enable Device"
msgstr "Wezesha Kifaa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Uncheck this box to disabled this device from being backed up."
msgstr "Ondoa tiki kwenye kisanduku hiki ili kuzima kifaa hiki kisihifadhiwe nakala."

#: includes/arrays.php router-accounts.php
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Maelezo"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Name of this device (will be used for config saving and SVN if no hostname is present in config)."
msgstr "Jina la kifaa hiki (litatumika kuhifadhi usanidi na SVN ikiwa hakuna jina la kipangishi kwenye usanidi)."

#: includes/arrays.php router-devices.php
msgid "IP Address"
msgstr "Anwani ya IP"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the IP Address used to communicate with the device."
msgstr "Hii ni Anwani ya IP inayotumika kuwasiliana na Kifaa."

#: includes/arrays.php router-devices.php
msgid "TFTP Server"
msgstr "Seva ya TFTP"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Optional TFTP server this device copies its configuration to. Leave blank to use the global TFTP Server setting."
msgstr "Seva ya TFTP ya hiari ambapo kifaa hiki kinanakili usanidi wake. Acha wazi ili kutumia mpangilio wa jumla wa Seva ya TFTP."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Stored SSH Host Key"
msgstr "Ufunguo wa Kipangishi cha SSH Uliohifadhiwa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Compare this host-key algorithm and SHA-1 hex fingerprint with the device through a trusted channel. On the server, replace the path below with the matching public host-key file and run: awk '{print $2}' /etc/ssh/ssh_host_ed25519_key.pub | base64 -d | openssl dgst -sha1 | awk '{print toupper($NF)}'. Use the device action to clear it after a legitimate key change."
msgstr "Linganisha algoriti hii ya ufunguo wa kipangishi na alama ya kidole ya heksadesimali ya SHA-1 na kifaa kupitia njia ya kuaminika. Kwenye seva, badilisha njia iliyo hapa chini na faili ya ufunguo wa umma wa kipangishi inayolingana kisha uendeshe: awk '{print $2}' /etc/ssh/ssh_host_ed25519_key.pub | base64 -d | openssl dgst -sha1 | awk '{print toupper($NF)}'. Tumia kitendo cha kifaa ili kuifuta baada ya mabadiliko halali ya ufunguo."

#: includes/arrays.php router-backups.php router-devices.php
msgid "Directory"
msgstr "Saraka"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the relative directory structure used to store the configs."
msgstr "Huu ni muundo sawia wa saraka unaotumika kuhifadhi usanidi."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/functions.php router-devices.php
msgid "Schedule Type"
msgstr "Aina ya Ratiba"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How often to Backup this device. Daily with a Rerun Every of 10 performs a backup every 10 days; Monthly performs a true calendar-month backup."
msgstr "Mara ngapi kuhifadhi nakala ya kifaa hiki. Kila Siku na Rudia Kila baada ya 10 hufanya hifadhi ya nakala kila siku 10; Kila Mwezi hufanya hifadhi halisi ya nakala ya mwezi wa kalenda."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/functions.php router-devices.php
msgid "Rerun Every"
msgstr "Endesha Tena Kila"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For Daily schedules, rerun the backup every X days. For Weekly schedules without specific Days of Week, rerun it every X weeks; once Days of Week are selected the backup runs on those days every week and this field does not apply."
msgstr "Kwa ratiba za Kila Siku, endesha nakala rudufu tena kila baada ya siku X. Kwa ratiba za Kila Wiki bila Siku maalum za Wiki, iendeshe tena kila baada ya wiki X; pindi Siku za Wiki zinapochaguliwa, nakala rudufu huendeshwa siku hizo kila wiki na sehemu hii haitumiki."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/scheduler.php
msgid "Days of Week"
msgstr "Siku za Wiki"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For a Weekly schedule, the day(s) of the week to run the backup on, every week. Leave empty to run every Rerun Every weeks instead."
msgstr "Kwa ratiba ya Kila Wiki, siku za wiki za kuendesha nakala rudufu, kila wiki. Acha wazi ili kuendesha kila baada ya wiki za Endesha Tena Kila badala yake."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/scheduler.php
msgid "Months of Year"
msgstr "Miezi ya Mwaka"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For a Monthly schedule, the month(s) of the year to run the backup in."
msgstr "Kwa ratiba ya Kila Mwezi, miezi ya mwaka ya kuendesha nakala rudufu."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/scheduler.php
msgid "Days of Month"
msgstr "Siku za Mwezi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For a Monthly schedule, the day(s) of the month to run the backup on (Last = last day of the month)."
msgstr "Kwa ratiba ya Kila Mwezi, siku za mwezi za kuendesha nakala rudufu (Mwisho = siku ya mwisho ya mwezi)."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/scheduler.php
msgid "Weeks of Month"
msgstr "Wiki za Mwezi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For a Monthly on Day schedule, the week(s) of the month to run the backup in."
msgstr "Kwa ratiba ya Kila Mwezi kwa Siku, wiki za mwezi za kuendesha nakala rudufu."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/scheduler.php
msgid "Days of Week (Monthly)"
msgstr "Siku za Wiki (Kila Mwezi)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For a Monthly on Day schedule, the weekday(s) to pair with the Weeks of Month selection."
msgstr "Kwa ratiba ya Kila Mwezi kwa Siku, siku za wiki za kuoanisha na chaguo la Wiki za Mwezi."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/functions.php router-devices.php
msgid "Device Type"
msgstr "Aina ya Kifaa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Choose the type of device that the router is."
msgstr "Chagua aina ya kifaa cha kipanga njia."

#: includes/arrays.php router-devices.php
msgid "Auto-Detect"
msgstr "Tambua Kiotomatiki"

#: includes/arrays.php includes/functions.php router-devices.php
msgid "Connection Type"
msgstr "Aina ya Muunganisho"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the type of connection used to communicate with the device."
msgstr "Hii ni aina ya muunganisho unaotumika kuwasiliana na Kifaa."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/functions.php router-devices.php
msgid "Authentication Account"
msgstr "Akaunti ya Uthibitishaji"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Choose an account to use to Login to the router"
msgstr "Chagua akaunti ya kutumia Kuingia kwenye kipanga njia"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "None"
msgstr "Hakuna"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Default timeout"
msgstr "Muda chaguo-msingi wa kuisha"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Default time to wait in seconds for a response"
msgstr "Muda chaguo-msingi wa kusubiri kwa sekunde ili kupata jibu"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Default sleep time"
msgstr "Muda chaguo-msingi wa kulala"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Default time to sleep in microseconds (1/1,000,000th of a second)"
msgstr "Muda chaguo-msingi wa kulala katika maikrosekunde (1/1,000,000 ya sekunde)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Assume elevated"
msgstr "Chukulia ruhusa za juu"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check this box to assume this device is always elevated"
msgstr "Tiki kisanduku hiki kuchukulia kuwa kifaa hiki kina mamlaka ya juu kila wakati"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Name of this device type."
msgstr "Jina la aina hii ya kifaa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Username Prompt"
msgstr "Kiashiria cha Jina la Mtumiaji"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the username prompt to match on login."
msgstr "Hiki ni kidokezo cha Jina la mtumiaji cha kulinganisha wakati wa kuingia."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Password Prompt"
msgstr "Kidokezo cha Nenosiri"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the password prompt to match on login."
msgstr "Hiki ni kidokezo cha Nenosiri cha kulinganisha wakati wa kuingia."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Configuration file"
msgstr "Faili ya usanidi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the standard location of the configuration file on the remote device. It is used for SCP and SFTP method"
msgstr "Hili ni eneo la kawaida la faili ya usanidi kwenye Kifaa cha mbali. Linatumika kwa mbinu ya SCP na SFTP"

#: includes/arrays.php router-devtypes.php
msgid "Copy TFTP"
msgstr "Nakili TFTP"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the CLI text used to send the backup to tftp server."
msgstr "Haya ni maandishi ya CLI yanayotumika kutuma nakala rudufu kwenye seva ya tftp."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Capture Command"
msgstr "Amri ya Kukamata"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Optional command whose output is saved as the configuration, instead of copying it to a TFTP server. It always runs over SSH, whatever the Connection Type, and the device then needs no TFTP server. Leave blank for devices that copy their configuration to TFTP. Example for MikroTik RouterOS: /export"
msgstr "Amri ya hiari ambayo matokeo yake huhifadhiwa kama usanidi, badala ya kuinakili kwenye seva ya TFTP. Huendeshwa kupitia SSH kila wakati, bila kujali Aina ya Muunganisho, na kifaa hakihitaji seva ya TFTP. Acha wazi kwa vifaa vinavyonakili usanidi wao kwenye TFTP. Mfano wa MikroTik RouterOS: /export"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Show Version"
msgstr "Onyesha Toleo"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the CLI text used to display the current version."
msgstr "Haya ni maandishi ya CLI yanayotumika kuonyesha toleo la sasa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Confirmation Prompt"
msgstr "Kidokezo cha Uthibitishaji"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the confirmation prompt to match before transmission."
msgstr "Hiki ni kidokezo cha uthibitishaji cha kulinganisha kabla ya utumaji."

#: includes/arrays.php router-devtypes.php
msgid "Confirm"
msgstr "Thibitisha"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Is there a confirmation prompt for copying the config?"
msgstr "Je, kuna kidokezo cha uthibitisho cha kunakili usanidi?"

#: includes/arrays.php router-devtypes.php
msgid "Force Confirm"
msgstr "Lazimisha Uthibitisho"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Is there a force confirmation prompt for copying the config?"
msgstr "Je, kuna kidokezo cha uthibitisho wa lazima cha kunakili usanidi?"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check End in Config"
msgstr "Kagua End katika Usanidi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check end in config?"
msgstr "Kagua end katika usanidi?"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Any Key prompt"
msgstr "Kidokezo cha Kibonye Chochote"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Text to match a 'Press Any Key To Continue' styled prompt"
msgstr "Maandishi ya kuoanisha na kidokezo cha mtindo wa 'Bonyeza Kitufe Chochote Ili Kuendelea'"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Post-Login Prompts"
msgstr "Vidokezo vya Baada ya Kuingia"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Optional prompt/response pairs sent right after login, before the copy-to-TFTP command, one per line as prompt|response. The prompt is matched as a case-insensitive regular expression against the device output (so it cannot itself contain |, and brackets and other special characters must be escaped, e.g. Save \\[y/n\\]), and the response is sent as typed, or use <CR> to send just a carriage return. A response is only sent once its prompt has been seen, either in the reply to the previous response or in later output; otherwise a warning is logged and nothing is sent. These are answered first; the Any Key prompt above is answered later, while the device is being enabled, so a prompt answered here never reaches Any Key. Example: Press any key|<CR>"
msgstr "Jozi za hiari za ombi/jibu zinazotumwa mara tu baada ya kuingia, kabla ya amri ya kunakili kwenye TFTP, moja kwa kila mstari kama prompt|response. Ombi hulinganishwa kama usemi wa kawaida usiozingatia herufi kubwa au ndogo dhidi ya matokeo ya kifaa (kwa hivyo haliwezi kuwa na |, na mabano pamoja na herufi nyingine maalum lazima zitoroshwe, k.m. Save \\[y/n\\]), na jibu hutumwa kama lilivyoandikwa, au tumia <CR> kutuma kurudi kwa mstari tu. Jibu hutumwa tu mara tu ombi lake linapoonekana, ama katika jibu la ombi lililotangulia au katika matokeo ya baadaye; vinginevyo onyo hurekodiwa kwenye kumbukumbu na hakuna kinachotumwa. Haya hujibiwa kwanza; ombi la Kitufe Chochote hapo juu hujibiwa baadaye, wakati kifaa kinawashwa, kwa hivyo ombi linalojibiwa hapa halifiki kamwe kwenye Kitufe Chochote. Mfano: Press any key|<CR>"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "General Settings"
msgstr "Mipangilio ya Jumla"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Presentation Mode"
msgstr "Hali ya Uwasilishaji"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Should Router Configs be presented on the Console or a Top Tab."
msgstr "Je, Mipangilio ya Ruta ionyeshwe kwenye Konsoli au Kichupo cha Juu."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Console"
msgstr "Kiweko"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Top Tab"
msgstr "Kichupo cha Juu"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Config Diff Context Lines"
msgstr "Mistari ya Muktadha wa Tofauti ya Usanidi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The default number of unchanged lines to display before and after each change when comparing two backups. A larger value makes it easier to see the surrounding configuration context. This may be overridden per comparison on the Compare page."
msgstr "Idadi chaguo-msingi ya mistari isiyobadilika ya kuonyesha kabla na baada ya kila badiliko wakati wa kulinganisha nakala rudufu mbili. Thamani kubwa hurahisisha kuona muktadha wa usanidi unaozunguka. Hii inaweza kubatilishwa kwa kila ulinganisho kwenye ukurasa wa Linganisha."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Connection timeout"
msgstr "Muda wa muunganisho umekwisha"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Maximum time to wait in seconds when establishing the initial network connection to a device. A hung or unreachable device is abandoned after this timeout so a scheduled backup run continues with the remaining devices."
msgstr "Muda wa juu wa kusubiri kwa sekunde wakati wa kuanzisha muunganisho wa awali wa mtandao na kifaa. Kifaa kilichokwama au kisichofikiwa huachwa baada ya muda huu kuisha ili nakala rudufu iliyopangwa iendelee na vifaa vilivyosalia."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Close without exit"
msgstr "Funga bila kuondoka"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If ticked, when closing down the device connection, no 'exit' command is issued"
msgstr "Ikiteuliwa, wakati wa kufunga muunganisho wa kifaa, hakuna amri ya 'exit' inayotolewa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Debug Connection Buffer"
msgstr "Bafa ya Muunganisho wa Utatuzi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Whether to log direct output of device connection"
msgstr "Iwapo kuweka kumbukumbu ya matokeo ya moja kwa moja ya muunganisho wa kifaa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Assume all devices elevated"
msgstr "Chukulia vifaa vyote vina ruhusa za juu"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Whether to assume all devices are elevated"
msgstr "Iwapo kudhani vifaa vyote vina ruhusa za juu"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Download Hour"
msgstr "Saa ya Kupakua"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The hour of the day to perform the full downloads."
msgstr "Saa ya siku ya kufanya upakuaji kamili."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Retry Schedule"
msgstr "Ratiba ya Kujaribu Tena"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The time to wait before attempting to perform an additional download when scheduled download fails"
msgstr "Muda wa kusubiri kabla ya kujaribu kupakua tena wakati upakuaji ulioratibiwa unashindwa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Retention Period"
msgstr "Kipindi cha Uhifadhi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The number of days to retain old backups."
msgstr "Idadi ya siku za kuhifadhi nakala rudufu za zamani."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Keep Inactive Device Backups"
msgstr "Tunza Nakala za Akiba za Kifaa Kisichofanya Kazi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "When checked, the retention cleanup will not delete aged-out backups that belong to disabled devices or to devices that have been removed, so configurations for decommissioned or unreachable equipment are retained."
msgstr "Ikiteuliwa, usafishaji wa uhifadhi hautafuta nakala za akiba zilizopitwa na muda ambazo ni za vifaa vilivyozimwa au vifaa vilivyoondolewa, ili usanidi wa vifaa vilivyoondolewa kazini au visivyoweza kufikiwa uhifadhiwe."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Transfer Options"
msgstr "Chaguo za Uhamishaji"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Default connection type"
msgstr "Aina chaguo-msingi ya muunganisho"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Default type of connection used to communicate with the device."
msgstr "Aina chaguo-msingi ya muunganisho unaotumika kuwasiliana na kifaa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Separate By Device"
msgstr "Tenganisha kwa Kifaa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Separate archived Configs into a folder per device"
msgstr "Tenganisha Usanidi uliohifadhiwa kwenye folda kwa kila kifaa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Dated Subdirectory"
msgstr "Saraka Ndogo Yenye Tarehe"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Insert a date-based subdirectory into the archive path (before the per-device folder), so each run is stored under its backup date, e.g. .../2020-11-04/hostname/.... Off preserves the existing layout."
msgstr "Weka saraka ndogo yenye tarehe katika njia ya kumbukumbu (kabla ya folda ya kila kifaa), ili kila mchakato uhifadhiwe chini ya tarehe yake ya nakala rudufu, k.m. .../2020-11-04/hostname/.... Ikiwa imezimwa, mpangilio uliopo utahifadhiwa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SCP Path"
msgstr "Njia ya SCP"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "When using SCP, leaving this blank will use PHP's SCP module which does not always work. External SCP is disabled while SSH host key verification is enabled because it cannot reuse the verified connection."
msgstr "Unapotumia SCP, kuacha hii wazi kutatumia moduli ya SCP ya PHP ambayo haifanyi kazi kila wakati. SCP ya nje imezimwa wakati uthibitishaji wa ufunguo wa kipangishi wa SSH umewashwa kwa sababu haiwezi kutumia tena muunganisho uliothibitishwa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Verify SSH Host Keys"
msgstr "Thibitisha Funguo za Kipangishi cha SSH"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Record each device's SSH host key on first connect and refuse to send credentials if it later changes. SSH/Telnet mode will not fall back to Telnet while verification is enabled. After a legitimate key change, use the device action to clear the stored host key."
msgstr "Rekodi ufunguo wa kipangishi wa SSH wa kila kifaa wakati wa kuunganisha mara ya kwanza na ukatae kutuma vitambulisho ukibadilika baadaye. Hali ya SSH/Telnet haitarudi kwenye Telnet wakati uthibitishaji umewashwa. Baada ya mabadiliko halali ya ufunguo, tumia kitendo cha kifaa kufuta ufunguo wa kipangishi uliohifadhiwa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "TFTP Server IP"
msgstr "IP ya Seva ya TFTP"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Must be an IP pointing to your Cacti server."
msgstr "Lazima iwe IP inayoelekeza kwenye seva yako ya Cacti."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "TFTP Backup Directory Path"
msgstr "Njia ya Saraka ya Hifadhi Nakala ya TFTP"

#: includes/arrays.php
