#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Include Config Diffs"
msgstr "Jumuisha Tofauti za Usanidi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Append a unified diff of each device whose configuration changed during the run to the backup Email, so a reviewer can see exactly what changed. Binary (non-text) configurations are skipped. Volatile lines that change on every backup (Cisco IOS '! Last configuration change', '! NVRAM config last updated', 'ntp clock-period' and 'Current configuration :', and NX-OS '!Time:' and '!Running configuration last done at:') are always ignored. Warning: the diff is sent in clear text to every recipient of the Email, so it can reveal configuration that should stay private; leave Include Secrets in Diffs unchecked."
msgstr "Ambatisha tofauti iliyounganishwa (unified diff) ya kila kifaa ambacho usanidi wake ulibadilika wakati wa uendeshaji kwenye Barua Pepe ya nakala rudufu, ili mkaguzi aweze kuona ni nini hasa kilichobadilika. Usanidi wa binary (usio wa maandishi) unarukwa. Mistari inayobadilika kwenye kila nakala rudufu (Cisco IOS '! Last configuration change', '! NVRAM config last updated', 'ntp clock-period' na 'Current configuration :', na NX-OS '!Time:' na '!Running configuration last done at:') hupuuzwa kila wakati. Onyo: tofauti hutumwa kwa maandishi wazi kwa kila mpokeaji wa Barua Pepe, kwa hivyo inaweza kufichua usanidi unaopaswa kubaki wa faragha; acha 'Include Secrets in Diffs' bila kuteuliwa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Include Secrets in Diffs"
msgstr "Jumuisha Siri katika Tofauti"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Send secret values in the emailed diff as they are. When unchecked (the default), the changed lines are found on the raw configurations and printed redacted, failing closed: lines containing secret-like words (passw, passphrase, pwd, secret, psk, key, community, md5, authentication, credential, token, private) and SNMP host and user lines are reduced to their first word followed by &lt;secret hidden&gt;, and every line of a PEM block, a certificate or key-string block, or a multi-line quoted value, and any hex or base64 row, is hidden; a block that never ends hides the rest of the configuration. This also hides harmless lines (e.g. a description mentioning a key), but every changed line still shows up, marked (changed) when only its hidden part differs, and a block that never ends is noted in the Email. Stored backups are never changed."
msgstr "Tuma thamani za siri katika tofauti inayotumwa kwa barua pepe jinsi zilivyo. Ikiwa haijatiwa alama (chaguo-msingi), mistari iliyobadilishwa hupatikana kwenye usanidi ghafi na kuchapishwa ikiwa imefichwa kwa usalama: mistari iliyo na maneno yanayofanana na siri (passw, passphrase, pwd, secret, psk, key, community, md5, authentication, credential, token, private) na mistari ya kipangishi na mtumiaji wa SNMP hupunguzwa hadi neno lao la kwanza likifuatiwa na &lt;secret hidden&gt;, na kila mstari wa kizuizi cha PEM, kizuizi cha cheti au mfuatano wa ufunguo, au thamani ya mistari mingi iliyo ndani ya nukuu, na safumlalo yoyote ya hex au base64, hufichwa; kizuizi kisichoisha huficha sehemu iliyosalia ya usanidi. Hii pia huficha mistari isiyo na madhara (k.m. maelezo yanayotaja ufunguo), lakini kila mstari uliobadilishwa bado huonekana, ukiwa na alama ya (changed) wakati sehemu yake iliyofichwa pekee ndiyo inayotofautiana, na kizuizi kisichoisha hutajwa kwenye Barua Pepe. Hifadhi rudufu zilizohifadhiwa hazibadilishwi kamwe."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Diff Exclude Patterns"
msgstr "Mifumo ya Kutenga ya Diff"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Optional regular expressions (one per line) matching configuration lines to ignore when comparing, so volatile lines such as timestamps or serial numbers do not show up as changes. Each pattern is matched case-insensitively anywhere in a line unless anchored with ^ or $; a pattern that is not a valid regular expression is ignored."
msgstr "Semi za kawaida za hiari (moja kwa kila mstari) zinazolingana na mistari ya usanidi ya kupuuza wakati wa kulinganisha, ili mistari inayobadilika kama vile mihuri ya muda au nambari za mfululizo isionekane kama mabadiliko. Kila mchoro hulinganishwa bila kuzingatia herufi kubwa au ndogo popote katika mstari isipokuwa ukiwekewa nanga kwa ^ au $; mchoro ambao si usemi wa kawaida halali hupuuzwa."

